    "disinherit": {
      "word": "DISINHERIT",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "To cut off from an inheritance or from hereditary succession; to prevent, as an heir, from coming into possession of any property or right, which, by law or custom, would devolve on him in the course of descent. Of how fair a portion Adam disinherited his whole posterity! South.",
